        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch VRM Characters Live in Your Miniature Garden</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for keeping you company while you work, or for a relaxing break—add a little extra joy to your daily routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch them, build for them, and watch them again. A miniature garden app that grows alongside your daily life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports loading up to 10 VRM models! The characters might even interact with the furniture you place!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Features】</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VRM Support: Up to 10 Characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your garden levels up, you can load up to 10 characters. Once they become residents of your garden, they will interact with the furniture you place. They might sit down to rest on a chair, sleep in a bed when they're tired, or just play around. Peek in to see them hanging out together or just enjoying their carefree lives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place ground tiles, walls, floors, doors, and furniture exactly how you like. Exchange your accumulated points for the items you want to create your very own unique miniature garden. As your garden levels up, new furniture and items will unlock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224640/extras/0a7459439f6daa23d42d4b886eb957f8.avif?t=1780761300\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224640/extras_big/0a7459439f6daa23d42d4b886eb957f8.webp?t=1780761300 width=1560 height=872 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Schedule Feature</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try registering your real-life schedule in the in-game calendar. When the time comes, you'll receive a notification right in your garden. Once you finish your task, check it off to earn points! You might even get a nice bonus for planning your schedule well in advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224640/extras/0202a0eaa744f2ef5a681643bb8bf064.avif?t=1780761300\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Garden Level</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your residents use furniture and enjoy themselves, the island’s Happiness Meter fills up, raising your Garden Level. Place plenty of nice furniture and facilities to keep your residents entertained! If you run out of points, just leave the game running while you work on other things. You'll earn points over time, and your residents will keep enjoying themselves while you're away!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224640/extras/a1889fd397a3b2412734e3d0269b620e.avif?t=1780761300\" width=369 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >↓</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224640/extras/5815d02e878e633fd38035bd71d22c68.avif?t=1780761300\" width=812 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Screenshot Feature</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the in-game screenshot feature to capture various moments of your residents' lives. Are they chatting? Resting? Fast asleep? Snap photos of different scenes and fill your memory folder!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224640/extras/ee118a4f412b518d4c10816056e69bd7.avif?t=1780761300\" width=1275 height=715 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resident Selfie Social Media</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every now and then, your residents will take selfies as they go about their day. Open <strong>VStory</strong> from the menu bar to check out their latest posts! They will update their feed with new selfies over time, so be sure to check in every once in a while.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224640/extras/58d3dc911269ec69f59626cc3b3eb200.avif?t=1780761300\" width=1434 height=804 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timer Feature</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I'll work hard until I reach this goal,&quot; or &quot;Just one more hour of focus!&quot; When you need a push, set the timer and get back to your tasks. Once the timer goes off, it might be the perfect time to gaze at your garden or do a little crafting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224640/extras/150f4c7ace690d84f915df2af060c464.avif?t=1780761300\" width=219 height=191 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Genre】</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle Sandbox</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulation</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch VRM Characters Live in Your Miniature Garden</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for keeping you company while you work, or for a relaxing break—add a little extra joy to your daily routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch them, build for them, and watch them again. A miniature garden app that grows alongside your daily life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports loading up to 10 VRM models! The characters might even interact with the furniture you place!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Features】</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VRM Support: Up to 10 Characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your garden levels up, you can load up to 10 characters. Once they become residents of your garden, they will interact with the furniture you place. They might sit down to rest on a chair, sleep in a bed when they're tired, or just play around. Peek in to see them hanging out together or just enjoying their carefree lives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place ground tiles, walls, floors, doors, and furniture exactly how you like. Exchange your accumulated points for the items you want to create your very own unique miniature garden. As your garden levels up, new furniture and items will unlock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224640/extras/0a7459439f6daa23d42d4b886eb957f8.avif?t=1780761300\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224640/extras_big/0a7459439f6daa23d42d4b886eb957f8.webp?t=1780761300 width=1560 height=872 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Schedule Feature</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try registering your real-life schedule in the in-game calendar. When the time comes, you'll receive a notification right in your garden. Once you finish your task, check it off to earn points! You might even get a nice bonus for planning your schedule well in advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224640/extras/0202a0eaa744f2ef5a681643bb8bf064.avif?t=1780761300\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Garden Level</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your residents use furniture and enjoy themselves, the island’s Happiness Meter fills up, raising your Garden Level. Place plenty of nice furniture and facilities to keep your residents entertained! If you run out of points, just leave the game running while you work on other things. You'll earn points over time, and your residents will keep enjoying themselves while you're away!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224640/extras/a1889fd397a3b2412734e3d0269b620e.avif?t=1780761300\" width=369 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >↓</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224640/extras/5815d02e878e633fd38035bd71d22c68.avif?t=1780761300\" width=812 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Screenshot Feature</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the in-game screenshot feature to capture various moments of your residents' lives. Are they chatting? Resting? Fast asleep? Snap photos of different scenes and fill your memory folder!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224640/extras/ee118a4f412b518d4c10816056e69bd7.avif?t=1780761300\" width=1275 height=715 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resident Selfie Social Media</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every now and then, your residents will take selfies as they go about their day. Open <strong>VStory</strong> from the menu bar to check out their latest posts! They will update their feed with new selfies over time, so be sure to check in every once in a while.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224640/extras/58d3dc911269ec69f59626cc3b3eb200.avif?t=1780761300\" width=1434 height=804 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timer Feature</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I'll work hard until I reach this goal,&quot; or &quot;Just one more hour of focus!&quot; When you need a push, set the timer and get back to your tasks. Once the timer goes off, it might be the perfect time to gaze at your garden or do a little crafting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224640/extras/150f4c7ace690d84f915df2af060c464.avif?t=1780761300\" width=219 height=191 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Genre】</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle Sandbox</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulation</p></li></ul>",
